Here's a small, self-contained C program that converts temperature from Celsius to Fahrenheit. It's short, easy to understand, and demonstrates basic input/output and arithmetic.

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    float celsius, fahrenheit;

    printf("Enter temperature in Celsius: ");
    scanf("%f", &celsius);

    // Conversion formula: F = (C * 9/5) + 32
    fahrenheit = (celsius * 9.0 / 5.0) + 32.0;

    printf("%.2f°C is equal to %.2f°F\n", celsius, fahrenheit);

    return 0;
}
```

**How to try it:**
1. Copy the code into a file named `temp_convert.c`.
2. Compile with: `gcc temp_convert.c -o temp_convert`
3. Run with: `./temp_convert`
4. Enter a temperature in Celsius and press Enter.

The program will output the equivalent in Fahrenheit, rounded to two decimal places.

Feel free to modify the formula or add error handling to make it your own!

Here's a simple, modern webpage for you! It's a clean landing page with a hero section and some content.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Simple Webpage</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: #f9fafb;
            color: #1f2937;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Content Section */
        .content {
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #1f2937;
            color: #9ca3af;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Button */
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background: white;
            color: #667eea;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 40px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
        <p>We create beautiful, modern, and functional web experiences that help your business grow.</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Get Started</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Content Section -->
    <section class="content">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 2rem; color: #1f2937;">Our Services</h2>
            <div class="cards">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>🚀 Web Design</h3>
                    <p>Modern, responsive designs that look great on any device.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>💻 Development</h3>
                    <p>Clean, efficient code built with the latest technologies.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>📱 SEO Optimization</h3>
                    <p>Get found by your audience with our SEO best practices.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2024 My Website. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
```
### Design Highlights

This page focuses on clean, friendly aesthetics to make a great first impression.

- **Friendly gradient hero:** The soft purple-blue gradient background immediately grabs attention and gives the page a welcoming, modern feel, while the white text and button create clear visual hierarchy.
- **Gentle card interactions:** The content cards use subtle shadows and lift on hover. This adds a touch of interactivity without being distracting, making the page feel dynamic yet professional.
- **Balanced color palette:** A light gray background with white cards and a deep navy footer keeps the layout calm and readable, allowing the vibrant hero section to stand out as the main focal point.

---

**Optimization Tip:** You can replace the placeholder text (like "Welcome to My Website") and the service descriptions with your own content and branding.
